  [
   "Characters of the same interest group who don’t share a bond or a rivalry are considered as level 1 bond."
  ],
  [
   "Notes on the model"
  ],
  [
   "- An ideology can sit in several groups. Two characters use the highest level they share."
  ],
  [
   "- A pair can hold a bond and a rivalry at the same time — allies on one axis, enemies on another."
  ],
  [
   "- ideology_moderate and ideology_child are excluded and stay neutral to everyone"
