   "Level 2 — Existential. They want each other dead. Slander, assassination, coup."
  ],
  [
   "Rules and checks"
  ],
  [
   "The one hard rule: no ideology may appear on both sides of a rivalry line. All 34 lines above are clean."
  ],
  [
